GLM53_TP3_KIT="/home/spark3/GLM53-TF3"
# glm53-tp4 re-pointed 2026-10-10: TensorFold TP4 (GLM-5.3-Flash-4x family, branch tp4 tip
# d220030, pinned image tensorfold-glm53:v0.6.0-*, 107 patches). Kit at $GLM53_TP4_TF_KIT on
# the head, container glm53-tf4, workers spark1+spark2+spark4 (scripts/local.sh WORKER/2/3),
# weights over NFS from spark3's dsv41-nfs export. See spark-bench
# models/glm-5.3-flash/tensorfold-tp4-trial/CUTOVER-2026-10-10.md.
# The pre-repoint knapcio/vLLM stack was DELETED 2026-10-10 (Victor's call, ~203G freed):
# containers glm53-alignfix-20260929-r0..r3 rm'd, image glm53-roce:v11-b58f34ea rmi'd on
