# /var/tmp/models/glm-quant-mix + nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4 removed on spark3.
# Kit + qmix plan archived at spark-bench backups/old-tp4-deleted-20261010/. NVFP4 base is
# re-downloadable (nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4, public); overlay rebuild documented in
# glm53-flash-nvfp4-4x-dspark-recipe runs/2026-09-29-knapcio-stack/RUNBOOK.md.
GLM53_TP4_TF_HEAD="spark3"
GLM53_TP4_TF_KIT="/var/tmp/glm53-tf4-trial"
GLM53_TP4_ENV=".env"
#
# NAME WARNING (restored 2026-09-29 — it applies to this recipe too): the served name
# says EXL3 and the weights are NOT EXL3. Verified on spark3's own config.json:
# quant_method=modelopt, quant_algo=MIXED_PRECISION (NVFP4 experts + MXFP8/FP8_BLOCK
# attention). The name is a stable IDENTITY LABEL that 99 Hermes config references pin
# to; it is not evidence of the backend. Do NOT "correct" it to match the quantization —
# that repoints every client. Read config.json when you need to know what is loaded.
GLM53_TP4_CTN="glm53-alignfix-20260929"   # DEFAULT ONLY — the kit's .env wins, see glm53_tp4_resolve_ctn()
GLM53_TP4_IMAGE="glm53-roce:v11-b58f34ea"
